WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.759
I'm looking for something special.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.820
My mom's birthday's coming up.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.120
How you feeling?

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.920
Still trying to get the taste of hospital jello out of my mouth.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:30.020
But the leg's feeling better.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:33.719
I thought of visiting.

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:36.640
It's okay, I understand.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.380
I've got to go. Bye.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:07.740
You sure about this?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.240
Just follow the plan, Nathan. Nobody will even know you're there.

00:01:12.359 --> 00:01:14.060
You smash, I grab.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.060
It's done.

00:01:17.379 --> 00:01:18.579
Do your thing, kid.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:30.019
Last time Martha was in, she made a point of trying these on.

00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:34.040
Did you try anything on that didn't have four numbers in the price?

00:01:35.379 --> 00:01:39.019
Well, I just got in some nice costume pieces from a local designer.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:40.719
Quite unique.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.340
Straight from outer space.

00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:48.760
Thanks, but I'll keep looking.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:02:24.900
I'll keep looking.

00:02:24.919 --> 00:02:26.919
I'll keep looking.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.419
Don't you move.

00:02:31.479 --> 00:02:32.859
The police are on their way.

00:02:35.419 --> 00:02:36.539
Clark, are you all right?

00:02:36.779 --> 00:02:37.019
Lana?

00:02:40.099 --> 00:02:42.019
Lana, it's my eyes. I can't see.

00:02:54.919 --> 00:02:55.419
How dark quickly.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.819
scene ...

00:03:05.479 --> 00:03:06.259
Oh my goodness!

00:03:09.539 --> 00:03:10.639
Busin.

00:03:16.759 --> 00:03:18.439
Dad, we're back.

00:03:18.859 --> 00:03:20.419
Hey Dad!

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:21.560
Hey, listen.

00:03:21.759 --> 00:03:23.279
I'll give them the call after arriveitnig.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.339
All right.

00:03:24.539 --> 00:03:24.899
Bye.

00:03:24.919 --> 00:03:29.919
I made this whole world shine for you.

00:03:29.919 --> 00:03:34.919
Yeah, yeah, come on.

00:03:43.919 --> 00:03:44.919
Here, honey.

00:03:44.919 --> 00:03:45.919
Sit back.

00:03:45.919 --> 00:03:46.919
There you go.

00:03:51.919 --> 00:03:52.919
Oh, Jonathan.

00:03:52.919 --> 00:03:54.919
We have to do something.

00:03:54.919 --> 00:03:57.919
Yeah, I know, sweetheart, but what?

00:03:57.919 --> 00:04:00.919
Clark's retinas were scarred by that heat burst,

00:04:00.919 --> 00:04:02.919
and you saw the doctor.

00:04:02.919 --> 00:04:03.919
He was baffled.

00:04:03.919 --> 00:04:04.919
He wasn't baffled, Jonathan.

00:04:04.919 --> 00:04:05.919
You handcuffed him.

00:04:05.919 --> 00:04:06.919
The last time we trusted a doctor,

00:04:06.919 --> 00:04:08.919
she sold his blood to Lionel Luther.

00:04:08.919 --> 00:04:10.919
Then we'll find someone we can trust.

00:04:10.919 --> 00:04:11.919
We cannot risk that.

00:04:11.919 --> 00:04:12.919
Clark has lost his sight.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:14.919
We may have to risk someone learning his secret.

00:04:14.919 --> 00:04:16.919
Martha, this is not about Clark's secret.

00:04:16.919 --> 00:04:19.919
His powers have now done something that have hurt him.

00:04:19.919 --> 00:04:21.919
And I think before we run out and just do something,

00:04:21.919 --> 00:04:23.919
we ought to think this whole thing through.

00:04:23.919 --> 00:04:24.919
You know what?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:25.920
Don't I get a vote?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:32.920
Of course you do, Clark.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.920
I think it may just be a question of time before I get better.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:41.920
Sweetheart, it could be permanent.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:45.920
And there's a lot of people who learn to live with disabilities every day.

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.920
What's the worst that can happen?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.920
Go to school and walk through a wall?

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.920
What do you mean?

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:57.920
College.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.920
I've been pretty good at exams.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:00.920
I saw one of the drunk.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:01.920
Was it in EC, then I was down in Truong?

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:02.920
None of that.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:03.920
How many times can I tell you that?

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:04.920
I said it's been years.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:05.920
I was with him,

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:06.920
he said he spoke with one of his friends,

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.920
he said he had PSA,

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:08.920
I can jump on that thing,

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:09.920
and said no that,

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:10.920
and I said nope.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.920
If he had constantly fell in love with me,

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.040
he would,

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.420
and if I still avoid him,

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:16.420
if that's the case,

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.920
when he does,

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.920
it's gonna be hard for me.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.920
Boy, when I'll interview Charles Sayles,

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.920
который sまで Gil Chemistry чтобы помiding,

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:23.920
I'd be hyped up over the fact that I had such a hard time with Plain Unfair.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.920
I think Judge Ross is gonna be giving this Masterson guy any breaks.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:31.920
Clark.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:34.920
You're already back.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:36.920
It's nothing quite that heroic.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:38.920
It's just a pit stop.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:41.920
Well, if you need anything, I'm here for you.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.920
Class notes, help writing your papers.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:58.920
One thing I learned from my accident is that you can't go through something like this alone.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.920
Ma, just because I'm blind doesn't mean the issues between us have disappeared.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.920
And this doesn't change anything.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.920
I was just offering a helping hand, Clark.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.920
But I won't make that mistake again.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:18.920
Laura said absence makes the heart grow fonder.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.920
Obviously hasn't met the two of you.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:24.920
But I'm sure you'll find something.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:52.920
Clark, what's the matter?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.920
Pete, did you hear that?

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:55.920
Hello?

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:56.920
Chloe?

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.920
Hello?

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:58.920
She's not here, Clark.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:06:59.920
Hello?

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.920
Pete, I can hear her right now.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.920
What do you want?

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.920
I'm at the store.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.920
This isn't the best place to talk.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:05.920
I'm done with this.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:07.920
Someone could hear me.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.920
I can't believe you're calling me, especially after everything that's happened.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:12.920
Look, I told you before.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:14.920
My researching Clark days are over.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:16.920
Really?

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:21.920
I have such a vivid memory of that young reporter, just eager to work for the Daily Planet.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.920
As an opportunity I provided for with only one requirement.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.920
Well, I gave you all the information I had, Mr. Luther.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.920
Well, but you have to look at Clark Kent as a work in progress.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:38.920
Tell me it didn't arouse your instincts as a journalist when you learned about Clark's blindness.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:43.920
Especially when the other people at the scene were treated with hearing-related traumas.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:47.920
Look, you're gonna have to find someone else to connect the dots, Mr. Luther, because I'm done with this.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:48.920
Huh?

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:49.920
What are you gonna do then?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:50.920
You gonna go running back to Lexington?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.920
Or what's left of him?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.920
Lex has a serious mental illness.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:08:00.920
It's as if there's a crack in his foundation, you understand?

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.920
The structure may look perfectly stable, but it can't take any pressure.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:09.920
So we will let Lex sit in his office sharpening pencils.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:14.920
But I expect a full report from you on Clark Kent, Ms. Sullivan, by week's end.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:19.920
What happened?

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.920
Pete, there's something wrong.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.920
You have to get me home right away.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:37.920
So these sounds, they just hit you all at once?

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:40.920
It's like someone turned on a giant stereo full blast.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.920
Suddenly all the sounds are magnified.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:43.920
There's the couch.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:45.920
And then they just went away.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.920
It was completely random.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.920
Well, with your X-ray abilities and your heat vision, we're done.

00:08:49.919 --> 00:08:53.919
I'm not really sure how your sensors are supposed to develop.

00:08:53.919 --> 00:08:55.919
It might just have been a one-time thing.

00:08:55.919 --> 00:08:58.919
Or maybe your body's trying to compensate for its lack of sight.

00:08:58.919 --> 00:09:01.919
I just hope it goes away.

00:09:01.919 --> 00:09:03.919
All the sounds, they were so loud.

00:09:03.919 --> 00:09:06.919
I didn't even know where they were coming from or what they were.

00:09:06.919 --> 00:09:11.919
But then there was Chloe and Lionel.

00:09:11.919 --> 00:09:14.919
What about them?

00:09:14.919 --> 00:09:17.919
They must have been on the phone.

00:09:17.919 --> 00:09:18.919
They were talking about me.

00:09:18.919 --> 00:09:20.919
I don't think it was for the first time either.

00:09:20.919 --> 00:09:22.919
Hey.

00:09:22.919 --> 00:09:23.919
Oh, Lex.

00:09:23.919 --> 00:09:24.919
Boy.

00:09:24.919 --> 00:09:25.919
It's nice to see you.

00:09:25.919 --> 00:09:26.919
Mr. Kent.

00:09:26.919 --> 00:09:29.919
Well, I have to go fill out some paperwork for Clark's principal.

00:09:29.919 --> 00:09:31.919
Yeah, stuff's due tomorrow.

00:09:38.919 --> 00:09:40.919
Clark, I don't know what to say.

00:09:41.919 --> 00:09:43.919
How about hello?

00:09:43.919 --> 00:09:46.919
Come on, behind the Ray-Bans, I'm still the same old Clark.

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:53.919
You know, when my father lost his sight, I, uh, I made contact with some of the world's top ophthalmologists.

00:09:53.919 --> 00:09:56.919
You just say the word and I can make any one of them available to you.

00:09:56.919 --> 00:09:59.919
Well, I appreciate that, Lex, but this isn't a problem to be solved.

00:09:59.919 --> 00:10:02.919
This is something I need to learn to live with.

00:10:02.919 --> 00:10:04.919
Look, I really don't want to talk about my condition.

00:10:04.919 --> 00:10:07.919
Even when people don't mention it, I can hear the concern in their voices.

00:10:07.919 --> 00:10:10.919
Trust me.

00:10:10.919 --> 00:10:13.919
I know the feeling.

00:10:13.919 --> 00:10:14.919
I discovered there's an almost...

00:10:14.919 --> 00:10:16.919
I discovered there's an almost...

00:10:16.919 --> 00:10:20.919
medieval prejudice against the survivors of mental illness.

00:10:20.919 --> 00:10:25.919
I decided the only way I could put the insinuations behind me is by proving my worth.

00:10:26.919 --> 00:10:28.919
How are you gonna do that?

00:10:28.919 --> 00:10:31.919
By returning to the Luther Corp.

00:10:31.919 --> 00:10:34.919
My father's offered me my old position back.

00:10:34.919 --> 00:10:37.919
Lex, do you think that job offer's for real?

00:10:37.919 --> 00:10:39.919
Why, Clark?

00:10:39.919 --> 00:10:41.919
You know something I don't?

00:10:41.919 --> 00:10:42.919
You know something I don't?

00:10:42.919 --> 00:10:43.919
You know something I don't?

00:10:43.919 --> 00:10:45.919
Look, I heard that that job offer's a sham.

00:10:45.919 --> 00:10:47.919
Your dad doesn't really think you're better.

00:10:51.919 --> 00:10:55.919
So he thinks I'm just gonna sit in my office and twiddle my thumbs?

00:10:55.919 --> 00:10:58.919
His exact words were sharpening pencils.

00:11:00.919 --> 00:11:02.919
Clark, where did you hear this?

00:11:04.919 --> 00:11:06.919
It doesn't matter where I heard it, Lex.

00:11:06.919 --> 00:11:09.919
The important thing is you need to be careful.

00:11:14.919 --> 00:11:15.919
I sweet-heart.

00:11:15.919 --> 00:11:16.919
Hi.

00:11:16.919 --> 00:11:20.919
You know, Jonathain, I was thinking.

00:11:20.919 --> 00:11:22.919
Maybe we should look into hiring some extra hands.

00:11:22.919 --> 00:11:25.919
You look tired. I'm concerned about you.

00:11:25.919 --> 00:11:26.919
Oh, Martha.

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:30.919
We're barely making ends meet as it is.

00:11:30.919 --> 00:11:33.919
And it won't help if you wind up in a hospital bed.

00:11:33.919 --> 00:11:34.919
I'll be all right.

00:11:34.919 --> 00:11:35.919
I just need...

00:11:35.919 --> 00:11:37.919
I need to catch my breath.

00:11:37.919 --> 00:11:38.919
What are you doing?

00:11:39.919 --> 00:11:41.919
Board of Education Disability Application

00:11:41.919 --> 00:11:42.919
to get ClarkЕНés selected.

00:11:42.919 --> 00:11:44.919
to get Clark a special teacher?

00:11:46.919 --> 00:11:49.919
His counselor said that he could take all of his regular classes.

00:11:49.919 --> 00:11:50.919
Until when?

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:53.919
His life has changed.

00:11:53.919 --> 00:11:56.919
And so is yours, but neither one of you will admit it.

00:11:56.919 --> 00:11:57.919
Martha.

00:11:57.919 --> 00:12:00.919
You both think you're supermen who can do everything alone,

00:12:00.919 --> 00:12:02.919
but you can't anymore.

00:12:03.919 --> 00:12:05.919
You need to start relying on people.

00:12:05.919 --> 00:12:07.919
And so does he.

00:12:12.919 --> 00:12:13.919
I'm sorry.

00:12:26.919 --> 00:12:29.919
So, I got a letter from the insurance carrier.

00:12:29.919 --> 00:12:32.919
Apparently my entire medical bill has been taken care of.

00:12:36.919 --> 00:12:39.919
Well, who said all insurance companies are evil?

00:12:41.919 --> 00:12:42.919
It wasn't your fault, Lana.

00:12:42.919 --> 00:12:43.919
It was mine.

00:12:43.919 --> 00:12:44.919
I pushed you into the stall.

00:12:44.919 --> 00:12:45.919
I spooked the horse.

00:12:45.919 --> 00:12:46.919
Lex, you were...

00:12:46.919 --> 00:12:47.919
Crazy?

00:12:49.919 --> 00:12:50.919
Not yourself.

00:12:50.919 --> 00:12:52.919
Semantics aside,

00:12:52.919 --> 00:12:55.919
you got caught in the crossfire trying to help me.

00:12:55.919 --> 00:12:57.919
For that, I'm truly sorry.

00:12:58.919 --> 00:13:01.919
As much as I appreciate the grand gestures,

00:13:02.919 --> 00:13:05.919
you could have just stopped by the town and said hello.

00:13:07.919 --> 00:13:10.919
Yeah, well, the grand gestures have always come easier.

00:13:10.919 --> 00:13:15.919
I'm sorry I couldn't be there during your rehabilitation,

00:13:15.919 --> 00:13:18.919
but I'm sure Clark was more than able to pick up the slack.

00:13:20.919 --> 00:13:22.919
Actually, Clark hasn't been around.

00:13:23.919 --> 00:13:26.919
We kind of decided that the best way to stop hurting each other

00:13:26.919 --> 00:13:28.919
was to stop seeing each other altogether.

00:13:30.919 --> 00:13:33.919
Given his new reality, I'm sure he could use your support right now.

00:13:35.919 --> 00:13:37.919
But the brave front's just an act, Lana.

00:13:37.919 --> 00:13:38.919
My father did the same thing.

00:13:38.919 --> 00:13:39.919
Lex, I've tried to reach out to you.

00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:42.919
I don't think my presence is going to raise his spirits.

00:13:48.919 --> 00:13:50.919
By the way, who's Adam?

00:13:54.919 --> 00:13:57.919
I noticed the Talon bill has included some gift basket

00:13:57.919 --> 00:13:59.919
sent to him at the Smallville Medical Center.

00:13:59.919 --> 00:14:01.919
I'm going to reimburse the shop.

00:14:01.919 --> 00:14:03.919
You still haven't answered my question.

00:14:05.919 --> 00:14:06.919
He's a good guy.

00:14:06.919 --> 00:14:07.919
He's a good guy.

00:14:07.919 --> 00:14:08.919
He's a good guy.

00:14:08.919 --> 00:14:12.919
He's a friend I made in physical therapy.

00:14:12.919 --> 00:14:14.919
Oh.

00:14:14.919 --> 00:14:16.919
Must have made quite an impression.

00:14:16.919 --> 00:14:18.919
Yeah, he did.

00:14:21.919 --> 00:14:23.919
Don't be a stranger.

00:14:38.919 --> 00:14:42.919
I'm so sorry.

00:14:42.919 --> 00:14:46.919
Clark?

00:14:48.919 --> 00:14:49.919
Chloe.

00:14:49.919 --> 00:14:50.919
Hi.

00:14:50.919 --> 00:14:57.919
Oh, fret that,000.

00:14:57.919 --> 00:14:58.919
Yeah.

00:14:58.919 --> 00:15:00.919
Ooh!

00:15:03.919 --> 00:15:05.919
Just give me the cocaine.

00:15:05.919 --> 00:15:08.919
Actually, I'm on something of a mission.

00:15:08.919 --> 00:15:10.919
Have you seen Pete?

00:15:10.919 --> 00:15:12.919
Sorry.

00:15:12.919 --> 00:15:14.919
Um...

00:15:14.919 --> 00:15:16.919
We were supposed to meet this morning

00:15:16.919 --> 00:15:18.919
and double-team on my Daily Planet column.

00:15:18.919 --> 00:15:20.919
Did the column Lionel Luther helped you land?

00:15:22.919 --> 00:15:24.919
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:28.919 --> 00:15:30.919
I may have lost my sight,

00:15:30.919 --> 00:15:32.919
but things are becoming much clearer now.

00:15:32.919 --> 00:15:36.919
Exactly how long have you and Lionel been looking into my life?

00:15:41.919 --> 00:15:43.919
Since last spring.

00:15:44.919 --> 00:15:46.919
The day after Lex's wedding.

00:15:50.919 --> 00:15:52.919
When you saw me and Lana together.

00:15:54.919 --> 00:15:56.919
Is that why you did this?

00:16:00.919 --> 00:16:02.919
Your silence is definite.

00:16:02.919 --> 00:16:04.919
What did you give him?

00:16:04.919 --> 00:16:06.919
